<title>THAILAND: Padaeng Industry 96 loss falls slightly.</title>
<headline>Padaeng Industry 96 loss falls slightly.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-03-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Audited financial results for year ending December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>		   (in millions of baht unless stated)</p>
<p>				 Twelve months</p>
<p>    Shr (baht)    loss     3.65     vs    loss    4.58</p>
<p>    Net	     loss   433.47     vs    loss  476.60</p>
<p>NOTES: Revs not stated. Company's full name is Padaeng Industry Plc, a zinc refinery operator and mining company.</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom 662-252-9950-3</p>
